  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reversing the Flow</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Reversing the Flow programme by RVO supports communities in vulnerable situations by strengthening their water security. It aims to make communities stronger with water and climate adaptation actions. The idea is that communities will organise, implement and lead these actions themselves. Communities are also supported to bring their learnings back to influence policies at different levels to create more space for locally-driven initiatives. This dialogue and dissent forum is therefore created to effectively find alternative or dissenting views from various (local) actors or CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
